From: Nico Pache <npache@redhat.com>
Subject: khugepaged: generalize __collapse_huge_page_* for mTHP support
Date: Wed, 16 Apr 2025 18:02:31 -0600

Generalize the order of the __collapse_huge_page_* functions to support
future mTHP collapse.

mTHP collapse can suffer from inconsistent behavior, and memory waste
"creep".  disable swapin and shared support for mTHP collapse.

No functional changes in this patch.

Link: https://lkml.kernel.org/r/20250417000238.74567-6-npache@redhat.com
Co-developed-by: Dev Jain <dev.jain@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Dev Jain <dev.jain@arm.com>
